## Guardrails

- **A settled reading is a decision, not a note.** It gets an owner and a consequence, or it is
  not settled.
- **Never let a reading contradict the matrix.** If C-n changes what a requirement asks for, the
  matrix row changes with it, in the same pass.
- **An amendment can invalidate finished work.** When one lands, re-check the sections it touches
  before submission — a response written against the superseded clause is non-compliant.
